<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Meteor Shower</h1>
<p>Sphere: Summoning Sphere
Class: none (no guild teaches it)
Mana: 25
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre><a cmd='#'>cast meteor shower</a>
use a wand of meteor shower
</pre>
<p>The caster raises both arms and calls meteors down from the sky on 
everyone in the room. It spares the caster, the caster's leader, and 
everyone who follows that leader, so your group is safe; anyone else in 
the room is struck, monsters and bystanders alike. Other players are only 
hit when both you and they have agreed to player killing (see 
<a cmd='#'>Help BoB</a>).
</p><p>It does about as well against any armour, and a shield softens the blow. 
Casting it is an attack and starts a fight with everyone it hits. It can be 
cast while fighting. No guild teaches it, but it turns up on wands among 
random treasure.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Group</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Summoning Sphere</a>
</pre>




</div>